  "CharacteristicValue": {
    "value": "High Speed",
    "ValidFor": {
      "startDateTime": "2023-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "endDateTime": "2023-12-31T23:59:59Z"
    }
  }
}
```

This structure allows entities to be properly managed over time, ensuring that stakeholders can understand the periods in which offerings, prices, and characteristics are relevant.

